{
  "name": "@gltf-studio/app",
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "private": true,
  "description": "Editor app shell (specs/ux-shell.md UX-1xx, specs/ux-scene-tree.md UX-2xx, specs/ux-viewport.md UX-3xx, specs/ux-data-tab.md UX-8xx): top bar, scene tree, real engine-three viewport (selection, hover, gizmo), inspector, bottom dock (Console, Data tab, Behavior graph (M4), and Script (M5) are real; Audio graph remains a placeholder).",
